{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31591","headline":"送萧十二校书赴郢州婚姻 · 李羣玉","name":"送萧十二校书赴郢州婚姻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓬莱才子即萧郎，彩服青书卜凤皇。\n玉佩定催红粉色，锦衾应惹翠云香。\n马穿暮雨荆山远，人宿寒灯郢梦长。\n领取和鸣好风景，石城花月送归乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}